WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.492
Nadia is a nurse. She works at the hospital from Monday to Thursday. She starts at seven and finishes at three in the afternoon.

00:00:07.742 --> 00:00:15.317
In the morning, she gets up at six. She drinks a coffee, but she doesn't eat. She takes the bus at half past six.

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:24.435
On Fridays, she doesn't work. She does the shopping and cleans her flat. In the evening, she goes to the cinema with her friend Julie.

00:00:24.685 --> 00:00:36.133
On Saturdays, Nadia visits her parents. They live in the countryside, an hour from the city. On Sundays, she rests: she reads, listens to music and sleeps a lot.
